          "Source: CCC Gambia site data report, 9 October 2026; recruitment covers 31 August–8 October 2026.",
          "Human enrolment is 46 diarrhoea cases, 22 community children and 33 household members (101 participants); the cohort specimen totals are 170 + 44 + 66 = 280.",
